        "value": "金 五千八百十二兩永八百二十七文五分"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "金（きん）五千八百十二両 永八百二十七文五分"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous tax (雜) paid in cash: 5,812 ryō plus 827.5 mon of ei (eirakusen accounting money) = 5,812.8275 ryō, since 1 ryō = 1,000 ei-mon. This column continues the 雜 block whose head (雜 / 米六百二石三斗一升七合六勺三才) is the last column of the facing page 117. The .8275 fraction is proved twice: the next column converts this sum to 726.60344 koku at 8 ryō/koku (5,812.8275 ÷ 8 = 726.6034375 ✓), and the 合米 total closes only on .8275. MASTER's parsed 5812.0827 is a digit-concatenation slip."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "金"
