        "value": "人口 三萬八千六百十九人（内 男壹萬七千三十四人 女一萬六千百五十六人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "人口（じんこう）三万八千六百十九人（内 男一万七千三十四人 女一万六千百五十六人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Population: 38,619. The 外ニ note on the next column makes clear the 2,724 shizoku/sotsu are counted OUTSIDE this figure. ⚠ The page does not balance here: the printed split below (男 17,034 + 女 16,156) sums to 33,190, leaving 5,429 unaccounted, and adding every status group on the page (2,724 + 458 + 130 + 32 + 63 = 3,407) still leaves 2,022. Every other male/female pair on this page sums perfectly, so this is a defect in the printed Miharu entry, not a reading problem — the total's nine glyph cells sit at a perfectly regular 84px pitch and read 三萬八千六百十九 unambiguously at single-character zoom. Two small printed marks (as dark as the type) sit inside this cell at the upper right of the 八 and of the 九 — i.e. against the two digits the shortfall implicates; they are enclosed in this box. MASTER's parsed 38619 is right; its transcription 三萬八千七百六拾九人 is wrong."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "人口"
      }
